<Document>


  <name><![CDATA[World Köppen]]></name>


  <open>1</open>


  <Snippet maxLines="0"><![CDATA[]]></Snippet>


  <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Köppen-Geiger climate type</b></p>


<p>Köppen-Geiger climate type map of the world based on:</p>


<p>Peel MC, Finlayson BL & McMahon TA (2007), Updated world map of the Köppen-Geiger climate classification, <i>Hydrol. Earth Syst. Sci.</i>, <b>11</b>, 1633-1644.</p>


<p>Download paper at http://www.hydrol-earth-syst-sci.net/11/1633/2007/hess-11-1633-2007.pdf</p>


<p>For more details see http://people.eng.unimelb.edu.au/mpeel/koppen.html</p>


]]></description>


  <styleUrl>#clean_balloon</styleUrl>


  <Style id="clean_balloon">


    <BalloonStyle>


      <text>$[description]</text>


    </BalloonStyle>


  </Style>


  <Style id="1">
    <LineStyle>
      <color>FFD8E9EC</color>
      <width>0.4</width>
    </LineStyle>
    <PolyStyle>
      <outline>0</outline>
      <fill>1</fill>
      <color>FFFF0000</color>
    </PolyStyle>
    <BalloonStyle>
      <text>
<![CDATA[Af]]>
<![CDATA[This is Af<br/>
                <br/>
                characteristics:<br/>
                - description : Tropical - Rainforest<br/> 
                - criteria    : precipitation of the driest month = 60
<br/>]]>      </text>
    </BalloonStyle>
  </Style>
