     <Folder>
       <name><![CDATA[Cwc]]></name>
<![CDATA[This is Cwc<br/>
                <br/>
                characteristics:<br/>
                - description : Temperate - Dry Winter<br/> 
                - criteria    : precipitation of the driest month in winter < precipitation of the wettest month in summer/10,Not (a or b) & 1 = number of months where the temperature is above 10 < 4
<br/>]]>       <Placemark>
